4. Database Design
The database uses the cpen208 schema. Primary keys identify records, while foreign keys connect related tables. Unique constraints prevent duplicate relationships and duplicate identifiers where required. Check constraints also restrict fields such as account status, enrolment status, credit hours, and payment amounts.

